\code{superlevel_merge_tree}, or \code{overlap_cell_complex} as appropriate, and
translate refinement controls into \code{simplify.params}.
There is no \code{merge_tree} alias. Arguments are \code{edge.length.list} and \code{field},
not \code{weight.list} and \code{f}.
\code{\link{as.basin.complex}} reconstructs compatible archived results
from their original graph and an available field; it is not a guarantee of
